<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab fighters captured a village near Mataban in central Somalia, extending their control in the region. In Minnesota, Somali-American Uber driver Mohamed Yusuf was brutally assaulted, his car stolen and he was run over, leaving him in a coma and prompting calls for a hate-crime investigation. Community and Muslim leaders are urging federal authorities to probe the attack as a hate crime. The conflict in Somalia continues to generate high fatalities, with 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNeFpKWGRrSWZ3bURCcE9URUo4SDlIQURWbER6TEpwcTRLeld1X1VoTFJtcWRLTFgzNWp3ZVpHeFBDTjEyR3ZtUFpERVJkZDZNNXRBUGFiUjZnYmNuUVRTTTVqZloxd25SM2VmRHFrYnYwcG85Wm15bzFxSHN3ZmRqbWpjOUlSdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxOQ2Q2bWNiSGpBUmtrY0o0eFVTeF9fci1DZmZEREhpc1F5RThfVXBGSUtLTXlwSW5rdlZENlpIS2F2cUppYl9IS29aNF9QYkZiQ0dDLWx0NE5kbTk1b3VzS0lYemwycjRFdy1tdnQ3VVIzX0ZXSG52eFFJRnFQZkNUd19BbENpQk9ER2JXSV9qd1FHWjJkc0F1ZHUxSWNKYmtCY0RoU3lJVFRldFpQLUZKNHdCXzZsRUs2VnJvelppOTNPbUFhOGk1MU82dGM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQM0QzRGZIakk0QkFFVk9xNk9YZ1Y3QW1aVTIzbm9ual9Qb2JzNDdja05Vb1ZZZGRoLVR2dS1tN1lfY0xRSTg4c1BoMVRndExjUDJ3dUdiX3Q4dS1FUjJDODJIVGQ2SXk2SUhaMlRTTVFxeGxJamE3ZHRyZ2hzVHlHM2tBVHdlV2N1U0llRlphaEdYTjVwb1NJ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxOVVpLZFNEV2paZDFnNnJWc3JCYk5mZXlGQ241eGIxSHY5ZUU0ZTQ1Q1I4MjVfSXZHUjJfMzdqaUJ4cE82QUhuUEEzUFhhTk5tQXk3SjhWM2xWaEVTaUZXZk5hdGdYazZ6dHNicUQzbE9WMlhHT2VGeDN6WHpBTzRFcDZwQXhiN3kwSC1YZHBhb1ZkbkE3eFd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Ne